I'll plan this weeknight stir-fry as a Rhylthyme program. Let me first check the public catalog, then build the program.

Since this is a specific, detailed recipe with precise timing constraints (two burners, 35 minutes, one cook), I'll build a custom program rather than search the catalog. The source text gives me everything I need.

Let me structure this:
- **Rice track**: rinse → boil → simmer → steam → fluff
- **Prep track**: chicken slice & marinate → broccoli/garlic/ginger → sauce
- **Stir-fry track**: heat wok → fry chicken → steam broccoli → finish → serve

The constraint is one cook and two burners (one for rice, one for wok), so I need to interleave prep work while rice is cooking.

```json
{
  "schemaVersion": "0.3.0-alpha",
  "programId": "weeknight-stir-fry",
  "name": "Weeknight Chicken and Broccoli Stir-Fry with Rice",
  "description": "Quick weeknight dinner for 2: jasmine rice, marinated chicken, broccoli stir-fry. Two burners, one cook, ~35 minutes.",
  "environmentType": "kitchen",
  "actors": 1,
  "tracks": [
    {
      "trackId": "rice",
      "name": "Jasmine Rice",
      "steps": [
        {
          "stepId": "rinse_rice",
          "name": "Rinse rice until water runs clear",
          "task": "prep",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 120 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "programStart" }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "boil_rice",
          "name": "Boil rice and water over high heat",
          "task": "stovetop",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 300 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "rinse_rice" }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "simmer_rice",
          "name": "Cover and simmer on low heat",
          "task": "stovetop",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 900 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "boil_rice" }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "steam_rice",
          "name": "Steam off heat, lid on",
          "task": "prep",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 600 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "simmer_rice" }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "fluff_rice",
          "name": "Fluff with fork",
          "task": "prep",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 60 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "steam_rice" }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "trackId": "prep",
      "name": "Prep: Chicken, Vegetables & Sauce",
      "steps": [
        {
          "stepId": "slice_chicken",
          "name": "Slice chicken thighs into thin strips",
          "task": "prep",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 300 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "programStart" }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "marinate_chicken",
          "name": "Toss chicken with soy sauce and cornstarch",
          "task": "prep",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 600 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "slice_chicken" }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "prep_vegetables",
          "name": "Cut broccoli florets, mince garlic and ginger",
          "task": "prep",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 300 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "marinate_chicken" }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "make_sauce",
          "name": "Mix sauce: soy, oyster sauce, sugar, vinegar",
          "task": "prep",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 120 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "prep_vegetables" }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "trackId": "stir_fry",
      "name": "Stir-Fry Execution",
      "steps": [
        {
          "stepId": "heat_wok",
          "name": "Heat wok until smoking",
          "task": "stovetop",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 180 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "boil_rice" }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "fry_chicken",
          "name": "Add oil and chicken, stir-fry until browned",
          "task": "stovetop",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 240 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "heat_wok" }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "remove_chicken",
          "name": "Remove chicken to plate",
          "task": "prep",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 30 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "fry_chicken" }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "steam_broccoli",
          "name": "Add broccoli with water, cover and steam",
          "task": "stovetop",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 180 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "remove_chicken" }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "add_aromatics",
          "name": "Uncover, add garlic and ginger",
          "task": "stovetop",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 30 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "steam_broccoli" }
        },
        {
          "stepId": "finish_stir_fry",
          "name": "Return chicken, add sauce, toss until glossy",
          "task": "stovetop",
          "duration": { "type": "fixed", "seconds": 60 },
          "startTrigger": { "type": "afterStep", "stepId": "add_aromatics" }
