This program respects:
- **Two burners** (stovetop: maxConcurrent=2) for rice pot + wok
- **One cook** (prep: maxConcurrent=1) so slicing, marinating, and vegetable prep don't overlap
- **35-minute target**: rice boil (5m) + simmer (15m) + steam (10m) + fluff (1m) = 31m; stir-fry starts after boil (5m) and takes ~9m, finishing around 32m total
- **Sequential tracks** with realistic durations from the source text

The program chains rice and stir-fry work efficiently: while rice simmers, prep happens; the wok heats as soon as rice boils; fluff and serve wrap up together.
